        <mxCell id="guardrails" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#1F3864&quot;&gt;Guardrails&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Weights ratified before any response is seen&amp;nbsp; &amp;#183; &amp;nbsp;Validation before decision, not after&amp;nbsp; &amp;#183; &amp;nbsp;Dual-cloud and payment-card compliance treated as entry gates&amp;nbsp; &amp;#183; &amp;nbsp;Cost of ownership assessed at current and ten times volume&amp;nbsp; &amp;#183; &amp;nbsp;Identical sizing reference issued to every vendor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#D9D9D9;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;fontColor=#404040;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
